# From the Launcher: Edit › Batch, scroll the grid to the top, pick 12 photos: All tiles 8-11 first (stand-in
# originals ① ② ③ ④, photo 1 = 1706 x 2559; tiles 1-3 are TC-112's saved portraits, 4-7 TC-060's squares),
# then tiles 4-7, 1-3 and 12. Ends on Batch Edit Room main screen.
lbl Edit
waitfor "Batch" --timeout 10
lbl Batch
fingerdrag 540 900 540 1700
fingerdrag 540 900 540 1700
tap 505 1370
tap 850 1370
tap 160 1650
tap 505 1650
tap 160 1025
tap 505 1025
tap 850 1025
tap 160 1370
tap 160 680
tap 505 680
tap 850 680
tap 850 1650
expect "(12/20)"
lbl Next
waitfor "Crop & Rotate" --timeout 15
